[{"title":"九日粤山登高醉中尽用五微韵成歌题曰将进酒","author":"黄佐","text":"将进酒，歌镂衣。\n举玉爵，停金鞿。\n凤琯龙笙，硕人其颀。\n于以解忧，式饮庶几。\n莼羹鲈脍纷哉馡，蟹黄初溢凫翠肥。\n促膝劝君君莫违。\n君不见朝始晖，夕转霏，鲁阳戈在谁能挥。\n嗟尔乌兔，胡为逐逐环我岩上扉。\n童时种柳今十围，钓游旧迹遍天地，想像徒依稀。\n幸无风萧萧，雨祈祈。\n三秋虽云杪，九月犹芳菲。\n有翩者鸟，嘤鸣相依。\n盍簪实难，知音亦稀。\n相逢不为乐，他时梦寐怀容辉。\n粲粲黄花，盈盈翠微。\n肃肃命驾，采采忘归。\n仰见云间翼，不入虞罗机。\n安能摧眉折腰谒朱门，趋琐闱。\n疏钟动，明星稀。\n酌复酌，酒行如翔翚。\n不醉明月将笑我，窥帘帏。\n羊肠世路艰且巍。\n犊有妃，妃呼狶。\n狐以为苍，当誉反讥。\n龌龊蓬茅丛，啼络纬，腾伊蝛。\n此中髑髅，昔曾牙绯。\n谷量牛马，尘积珠玑。\n僮奴策骖焱騑騑，薰天势倏成露晞。\n纵能化鹤去千载，华表谁真逢令威。\n南溟徙鹍鹏，西北荒蕨薇。\n商颜绝萝径，渭曲空渔矶。\n古来豪圣今尽非，徒劳营魄聆音徽，穷经何用编绝韦。\n我且濯明河而振缨，翳扶光以乐饥。\n吐情向君君莫笑以诽。\n醉来长啸粤山上，浮云直北连燕畿。\n山中多木，矗矗如旗。\n其下流水，活活清于沂。\n粤王一去古台在，惟有飘飘霜叶飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4247,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珠江夜别亲友","author":"黄佐","text":"祖帐循珠浦，离杯对玉轮。\n分襟移鹢首，鼓棹动龙鳞。\n剑气千年合，风期万里亲。\n只应开阁待，今有汉平津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4248,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨","author":"黄佐","text":"肤寸云初起，弥天雨正狂。\n鱼龙空窟宅，草木各辉光。\n爽气连南纪，愁阴接上方。\n故山青未了，归梦此宵长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4249,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对月二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"旅馆维舟后，江天入望时。\n兔蟾当北斗，乌鹊绕南枝。\n只恐金波溢，宁教玉漏迟。\n火云消已尽，真觉近秋期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4250,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对月二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"江月初成镜，山城独倚楼。\n徘徊如伴客，浩荡更随舟。\n陌上清光满，尊前烂漫游。\n岂知离别后，对尔转添愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4251,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟度彭蠡遇风作","author":"黄佐","text":"奔策遵玄渚，扬帆向紫都。\n遥林吹地籁，巨浪舞天吴。\n汇泽开长道，风飙动壮图。\n扶摇自有适，何必美游凫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4252,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京邸春日思家","author":"黄佐","text":"金市乘羊路，铜街试马群。\n夜吟低霁月，春梦断浮云。\n上巳兰英会，新年柏叶醺。\n斑衣今未拂，休寄锦回文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4253,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日","author":"黄佐","text":"四载逢元日，悠悠燕冀间。\n河山双鬓短，风雨一灯闲。\n凤沼随恩泽，龙墀整佩环。\n辞家长素食，真愧紫宸班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4254,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"黄佐","text":"独坐禅扉迥，怀归思窅然。\n花光明薄暮，莺语入新年。\n彩仗随春动，华灯与月悬。\n绝怜风景美，不是粤山川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4255,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春郊外","author":"黄佐","text":"五日逢休沐，千山得胜游。\n楼台萧寺迥，花竹习池幽。\n春事已黄蝶，旧盟惟白鸥。\n烟尘奔走地，回首意悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4256,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下赠张子文邦","author":"黄佐","text":"独榻依萧寺，清尊散暮愁。\n疏钟闻上苑，片月在飞楼。\n天地双龙剑，江湖一钓舟。\n壮怀吾共汝，摇落岁云秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4257,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次韵赠张子","author":"黄佐","text":"长安木叶下，萧萧生客愁。\n夜寒空对酒，云澹独登楼。\n柳岸横长笛，花滩放小舟。\n向来江海意，凄断为清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4258,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"速张侍御补之同访文邦诗以代简","author":"黄佐","text":"秋风起阊阖，渺渺独愁予。\n水落蒹葭冷，天长鸿雁疏。\n兰台思楚客，枫叶咏吴趋。\n骢马招携地，琴尊信所如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4259,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廖子鸣吾秋日见怀次韵二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"吾爱白鹿子，诗传鹦鹉洲。\n隋珠偏照夜，宋玉最伤秋。\n水绿芙蓉渚，霜黄悲翠楼。\n相看成去住，徒尔赋离忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4260,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廖子鸣吾秋日见怀次韵二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"知尔龙山饮，凭高凤野开。\n日从燕树转，云自汉宫来。\n目尽天南雁，心飞江上台。\n杜陵空抱病，庾信独生哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4261,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弥罗阁秋望二首与马子仲房 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"珠阁拂瑶天，凭轩兴渺然。\n西风吹野水，高柳送鸣蝉。\n冠盖黄尘里，关河白雁边。\n相逢且披豁，随意问玄玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4262,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弥罗阁秋望二首与马子仲房 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"羽观临霄汉，飙台出薜萝。\n霞觞延客久，琪树受凉多。\n日色隐平楚，秋声连大河。\n君看惬幽意，吾醉即狂歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4263,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日游迎祥寺至玉泉与张杨赵陆四子同分韵得松知二字 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"珠林开鹫峰，下马闻疏钟。\n绀殿已狐兔，翠琰空蛟龙。\n对酒感慨发，褰衣霜露浓。\n苍苍暮色动，秋声满寒松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4264,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日游迎祥寺至玉泉与张杨赵陆四子同分韵得松知二字 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"迢递寻莲宇，淹留咏桂枝。\n玉骢穿柳入，锦席傍泉移。\n山翠浮龙苑，云光溢雁池。\n尘心今已净，应有白鸥知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4265,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋不见月文徵仲席上赋","author":"黄佐","text":"明月隐天端，疏灯耿夜阑。\n浮云飞不尽，万里若为看。\n晕落鹏霄迥，光生凤阙寒。\n谁能天柱上，吾意欲骖鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4266,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜宴陈子学宅赏菊分韵得微字","author":"黄佐","text":"黄菊冬犹艳，清歌夜未归。\n兴从添烛剧，寒到引杯微。\n宫漏挟风度，塞禽冲月飞。\n物华容易尽，心赏莫教违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4267,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新春","author":"黄佐","text":"尧历开元岁，殷邦数中兴。\n苑花红未入，宫草翠先凝。\n功业时看剑，栖迟夜向灯。\n匡扶在诸老，贫病任相仍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4268,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋夜对月","author":"黄佐","text":"作客惊秋半，行歌对月明。\n玉轮看桂满，银浦见槎横。\n疏柳门墙静，高梧风露清。\n此时裁谢赋，千里一含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4269,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"素翁先生元日书怀次韵二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"许身齐稷契，挥手谢巢由。\n鹊起千人悦，龙飞万国休。\n王春随听履，卿月照稽谋。\n一任云庄上，莺花锁鹭洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4270,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"素翁先生元日书怀次韵二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"归兴凭谁语，裁诗每自怜。\n草青壶峤外，鸥白影池前。\n淑气通嘉石，祥飙洒列钱。\n即看吾道在，行止信皇天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4271,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎祥寺后游次韵四首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"五载吾重到，双林路欲迷。\n梯飙寻绝境，拂翠见灵溪。\n石洞云堪卧，花宫鸟自啼。\n迟回意无限，归骑及乌栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4272,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎祥寺后游次韵四首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"辇毂环龙象，耽游未拟回。\n金貂何处所，珠鸟至今来。\n芳树含青霭，丰碑净绿苔。\n琼帘自舒卷，谁见化人开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4273,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎祥寺后游次韵四首 其三","author":"黄佐","text":"沙柳明秋色，烟萝出梵香。\n川原双步屧，感慨一持觞。\n慧日无人相，慈云不住方。\n世缘如可度，留宿远公房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4274,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎祥寺后游次韵四首 其四","author":"黄佐","text":"白马开三乘，祥鶤运九衢。\n乾坤经浩劫，陵谷尽浮图。\n柳径涵川净，枫林带藓枯。\n倦游仍立马，寒日动平芜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4275,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中夜宴赠别胡苏州","author":"黄佐","text":"荡楫语深夜，知君怀草堂。\n微云开震泽，锦瑟奏伊凉。\n飒飒满红树，翩翩飞紫凰。\n曲终酒亦醉，明日各殊方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4276,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虎丘怀古","author":"黄佐","text":"寂寞吴王国，笙歌入海云。\n夫椒先自败，于越遂能军。\n月落苧萝冷，花深麋鹿群。\n千年金虎去，谁守阖闾坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4277,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别黄武进同年","author":"黄佐","text":"武进仙凫驻，三年报政成。\n阎闾无复叹，山水有馀清。\n渺渺舟楫去，苍苍霜月明。\n停云时隐几，河汉欲三更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4278,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别韦评事归靖江","author":"黄佐","text":"抗疏甘南谪，知君不负丞。\n离情江上树，聚首驿前灯。\n幽谷歌鸣鸟，天池息大鹏。\n扁舟汛明月，回首梦毗陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4279,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得子弥月二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"犀果欣延客，风尘慰索居。\n老亲期有后，游子敢无书。\n赋命由天地，他年定智愚。\n谁能识英物，啼看问何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4280,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得子弥月二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"定省心千里，栖迟梦一丘。\n冰霜仍作客，江海更停舟。\n去去怜渠小，呱呱解旧愁。\n轩车那可问，为尔重淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4281,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春","author":"黄佐","text":"野馆依寒渚，愁吟且未回。\n春从今日到，花在故园开。\n白雪裁仙调，青云捧御台。\n阳和不负客，偏入掌中杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4282,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨木冰正月二日作","author":"黄佐","text":"野树纷纷白，连朝雨木冰。\n人情怜上朔，天意望中兴。\n絮雪风难起，梨云日易蒸。\n春王调玉烛，何事有严凝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4283,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潞河元夜","author":"黄佐","text":"水国明鳌火，烟花接凤城。\n绝怜今夜酒，空复异乡情。\n宝马嘶尘度，银蟾倚树明。\n客愁无处看，况乃管弦声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4284,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冻开初发","author":"黄佐","text":"万里图南翼，逢春始计程。\n彤云辞魏阙，绿树出秦京。\n鼓枻江天豁，流澌野岸平。\n因风传尺素，应慰倚门情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4285,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河西午憩","author":"黄佐","text":"水驿远郊圻，居然尘事稀。\n酒帘明柳市，渔网集苔矶。\n隐几白日静，开帘黄鸟飞。\n行边有林壑，未觉素心违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4286,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天津雨中即事","author":"黄佐","text":"幕府开三卫，粮漕集万艘。\n人皆甘海错，吾且醉村醪。\n潮落洲随出，烟深岸却高。\n冲泥走风雨，端坐看儿曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4287,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"修复粤洲草堂经始桃源坞四首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"草堂修旧业，凿翠向高城。\n俯首嗟人境，冥心谢世情。\n山从疏树众，江入大荒平。\n隐几云霞里，脩然得此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4288,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"修复粤洲草堂经始桃源坞四首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"桃源初小筑，茆屋可衰翁。\n井市锥刀外，生涯一亩中。\n乔林闻独鸟，幽谷送长风。\n朋好今如此，清尊谁与同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4289,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"修复粤洲草堂经始桃源坞四首 其三","author":"黄佐","text":"日明花外路，雨长竹间泉。\n隔谷难逃俗，依山自觉仙。\n功名归坠甑，宇宙入浮烟。\n已悟逍遥化，从今结静缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4290,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"修复粤洲草堂经始桃源坞四首 其四","author":"黄佐","text":"排闼分青嶂，充庭尽绿柯。\n敛神知日永，高步觉天多。\n返照满城郭，孤烟生薜萝。\n到家三舍近，尘土竟如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4291,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周秋斋方伯归闽二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"珠江愁送客，薇省喜留君。\n车马三城动，讴歌百粤闻。\n沧洲难吏隐，紫极易风云。\n去去吾何道，甘随麋鹿群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4292,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周秋斋方伯归闽二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"南海瞻冠冕，东风吹旆旌。\n封棠无剪伐，骑竹有逢迎。\n春舫随花发，秋容入镜平。\n因思木兰水，端可濯吾缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4293,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月二十日梦中作七夕诗觉而忆其全篇录以纪异","author":"黄佐","text":"凉色晚幽幽，疏梧知早秋。\n古来传帝子，今夕会牵牛。\n大泽生明月，苍崖带远流。\n凭高语天上，何事有离愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4294,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酌泰泉赠区广文","author":"黄佐","text":"一勺泰泉水，中涵千仞青。\n远分舒鹤渚，寒带聚龙坰。\n花竹添萧爽，风云助杳冥。\n看君苏齿颊，为尔续茶经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4295,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿灵川寄怀范大参","author":"黄佐","text":"性拙嗟无侣，交深赖有君。\n襟期珠海月，去住桂山云。\n黄屋匡扶切，苍生轸念勤。\n灵川烟雨里，忧乐梦希文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4296,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兴安道中","author":"黄佐","text":"放浪沧洲客，迟回桂水春。\n密云虚碍马，芳草远随人。\n野阔啼莺树，山多佩犊民。\n戍歌愁听汝，荒服几时新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4297,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"卧病梧山晓，怀归菊径秋。\n凄风催叶下，积雨入江流。\n遂有鲈鱼兴，聊为鸿雁谋。\n飘摇寄生事，天地一扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4298,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"长笛送愁思，孤琴随病身。\n鸦翻中夜月，鹊报故乡人。\n千里庭闱梦，十年岐路尘。\n悠然念黄绮，误逐汉廷臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4299,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀徐养斋方伯","author":"黄佐","text":"多病朋簪盍，他乡意绪孤。\n梧江通百粤，桂岭隔三吴。\n归鸟择云木，游鱼依渚蒲。\n何时同孺子，高枕著潜夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4300,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村书舍为滇人魏德如赋","author":"黄佐","text":"勋业看朝镜，诗书伴夜檠。\n下帷芳草色，闭户远潮声。\n飞跃形吾道，渔樵乐此生。\n鹍鹏终变化，滇国本南溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4301,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"控海楼有怀徐可大","author":"黄佐","text":"南州徐孺子，落笔满人间。\n江上笑为别，天边去不还。\n高楼题控海，此日独看山。\n尚忆危言日，投簪且闭关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4302,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崖山纪游次郑李二子韵二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"岁晚空山静，遥闻猿鹤音。\n胶舟前日事，倾盖此时心。\n渔戙乘潮急，樵歌隐雾深。\n停杯发高咏，兴剧不成斟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4303,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崖山纪游次郑李二子韵二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"夕阳惟鸟雀，古道半榛荆。\n蠹饱祠中木，苔侵石上铭。\n英灵终寂寞，风物自凄清。\n仰羡东山老，劳歌空复情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4304,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泰泉山中赠伦王二子","author":"黄佐","text":"金涧绕青林，瑶空出翠岑。\n烟霞供永啸，松竹入长吟。\n春度莺犹在，杯香客每深。\n随时共幽赏，吾未倦登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4305,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂避暑四首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"林壑谒苍苍，层崖曲抱塘。\n闭门蛙鼓竞，欹枕鸽铃长。\n霞珥混斜照，炎威连大荒。\n冥心对鹥鹭，将尔共沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4306,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂避暑四首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"隐几消永日，薰风摇紫薇。\n钩帘一以眺，绿水近岩扉。\n嗒尔烟光夕，居然尘事稀。\n翩翩松上鹤，遥带白云归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4307,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂避暑四首 其三","author":"黄佐","text":"蹙啸延清籁，长谣集绪风。\n岭云偏向北，郁水亦流东。\n地切三边戍，天开万寿宫。\n飞仙挟明月，应得到崆峒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4308,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂避暑四首 其四","author":"黄佐","text":"徙倚碧氛氲，行歌许鹤闻。\n剪茅通月色，攒石聚霞文。\n袅袅竹到水，喤喤钟度云。\n悠然俯尘世，天外自为群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4309,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日雨霁出门志喜","author":"黄佐","text":"王春听旧雨，人日见新晴。\n万户笙歌沸，千山紫翠明。\n和风匀柳色，淑气入莺声。\n所喜青阳动，休嗟白发生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4310,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谷日陈茶山少参席上赋","author":"黄佐","text":"谷日过从喜，薇垣礼数稀。\n杯深花共劝，坐久月同归。\n南海楼船静，东吴粳稻肥。\n使君能化俗，未许问渔矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4311,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨次陈茶山韵二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"献岁初逢雨，随车且泽民。\n小楼听到晓，幽谷见回春。\n燕雀依巢静，鱼龙出浪频。\n沧洲理烟艇，蓑笠定随人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4312,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨次陈茶山韵二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"吾爱茶山子，吴讴播粤民。\n檐声才入夜，野色尽成春。\n水渐浮舟阔，花堪对酒频。\n向来雩祷切，天果不遗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4313,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]